(--- Family monthly add-ons \(logic in membership builder JS.js\) ---) Tj T*
(Base = family base for selected tier and child count \(see tables\).) Tj T*
(If any child age is empty or invalid: monthly due = base only \(no add-ons\).) Tj T*
(When all ages are filled, add-ons apply:) Tj T*
(  * Age > 17: +$90 for 1st child; 2nd+ use 100 - \(childIndex - 1\) x 10 \(2nd: +$80, 3rd: +$70, ...\).) Tj T*
(  * Age 14-17: +$15 each.) Tj T*
(  * If average age of all children <= 6 and at most 2 children: -$30 \(one child\) or -$20 \(two children\).) Tj T*
(  * For 3rd+ child: if that child's age > 4, +$20 each.) Tj T*
(Final monthly due = base + additional charges \(after the adjustments above\).) Tj T*
